hi i'm evan carmichael and today i'm  going to be sharing with you  seven ways to achieve wealth and success  these are the seven things that you need  to do to accomplish your goals to hit  your big dreams  and to build a successful business ready  here we go  number one is follow your passion you  have to follow your passion  you have to love what you do so many  entrepreneurs start a business just  trying to make money and if that's your  end goal  it's never going to work out look at the  most successful entrepreneurs at all  time look at them all  look back to how they started look back  to why they started  it was never just to make a lot of money  yes  you need to make money this is not a  charity i want you to make lots of money  but the path to money comes by following  your passion  you have to do something that you feel  here something that's making the world a  better place something that truly  helps people not just something that  you're trying to make a lot of money off  of because if that's your only goal if  money is your only goal  you're never going to make it you have  to follow your passion and do  what you love number two is figure out  what you stand for  what do you stand for who are you give  me  one word that describes who you are and  what you're all about and then express  that to the world  because if you want to have success as  an entrepreneur it's not just about  selling products and services  people want to know who you are and what  you stand for  and if people can connect to you and  feel your purpose  and know why you're doing this then  they're much more likely  to buy from you to tell their friends  about you and pay a premium  and drive further and spend more money  to work with you compared to other  people because they connect with that  purpose  so what do you stand for make it one  word make it simple  make it easy to understand and use it in  all your marketing so that people can  talk about you  number three is model success whatever  goal you have for your business  it's already been done people have  already accomplished  whatever it is that you're trying to do  you don't have to reinvent the wheel  for everything you don't have to come up  with every new idea  for your business the fastest way to  accomplish success is to model success  find people who've already done what  you're trying to do  research their strategies and apply it  to your business  to get results that you can get results  in days what may have taken somebody  else  years to do or you decades to figure out  because you have some working strategies  so model success find entrepreneurs that  you look up to who've done what you want  to do  and apply their lessons to your business  number four is don't spend until you  earn  anybody can spend money okay anybody if  i gave you a million dollars you could  find a million different ways to do it  not everybody can make money can earn  money  this is a challenge for a lot of  entrepreneurs so when you're first  starting up  don't focus on where you can spend the  money you don't need an office  you don't need business cards you don't  need a new suit you don't need a car you  don't need  any of that stuff what you need is your  hustle you need  hustle and investing from your profits  and not from your pockets okay don't go  out and spend a ton of money on  something to get it started  find a way to start small without  investing money invest your time  to make something work to start seeing  some dollars then  invest that back into your business to  grow don't spend  until you earn number five is over  deliver like crazy  the best marketing strategy that i know  is to over deliver  like crazy when you get your first  customer  go crazy servicing them give them way  more than they ever thought they would  get you know they're paying you for  x and what you want to provide is x y z  right give them way more over deliver go  way outside  the scope of what was expected from you  because  when you first get started you know when  they hire you to do whatever project or  they buy whatever product from you  you're you're one person of many that  they're working with  right you're a tiny piece of their life  or of their business  you want to make that piece bigger you  want to become more important  for example you're selling to businesses  you don't want to just be  another service provider to them you  want to be an integral part of their  business  you want them thinking i can't imagine  how we ever did this  without this person helping us you have  to be that important  so you have to start over delivering  like crazy give them so much value  that they can't imagine ever continuing  on  without you how do you provide that kind  of value because when you can do it  they're going to give you bigger budgets  they're going to give you more projects  they're going to order way more for you  they're going to refer  other people to you you got to get that  word of mouth going because you can't  afford  to go out and take out super bowl ad  commercials right  over deliver like crazy number six  is focus your efforts you have to stay  focused okay as entrepreneurs we've got  a million and one things to do in our  business we have a million one  ideas of where we could take the company  you need to stay  focused okay find the one thing that you  are one of the best people at the world  in and instead of diverting your  attention to try to cover all these  million different things  picked out one thing focus on it make it  amazing  be the best in the world at it share  your knowledge and you'll get  way better output by focusing on what  you're really good at and love doing  than if you're trying to scatter your  focus across all these different efforts  cut everything else out and stay focused  and number seven is create a supportive  environment a huge challenge for  entrepreneurs is staying motivated  listen one day you're all excited you're  going hard you've got this big dream  you've got this big goal you're going to  make it happen this is the day  you're going to land this client  whatever it is you're super pumped and  motivated and excited  and then the next day it's like you're  starting all over again and then you  don't believe in yourself and say ah  i don't think i can hit that goal and  and you know where did all my energy go  you need to create an environment  that supports you regularly where you  wake up you have a routine  that supports you that you're surrounded  with people  and books and ideas and media and in  an office space or working environment  that supports you that builds you up  that make you believe in yourself  that give you confidence to keep going  and you may be thinking well i don't  have  those kinds of friends i don't have  those people in my life right now  design it right if you have friends who  aren't supporting you  get new friends right if you need  mentors to help guide you  you don't know any super successful  billionaire entrepreneurs to  give you encouragement and motivation  read their stories  find their videos check out their  interviews right  being surrounded by these people even if  you don't know them personally  rubs off on you gets you more motivated  seeing an interview with jay-z or  richard branson or whoever it is  might spark something in you start your  day with that  watching videos like this maybe that's  the fuel that you need to get going  start your day so you have that first  thing in the morning and you're ready to  go for the rest of the day  you need to design an environment that  every day supports you  to go out and believe in yourself and  accomplish your goals  so in summary the seven ways to achieve  wealth and success number one  follow your passion number two figure  out what you stand for  number three model success number four  don't spend until you earn  number five overdiver like crazy number  six focus your efforts and 